    {
      "id": "r20261105-a02",
      "title": "The Community Fridge",
      "level": "Menengah",
      "min": 3,
      "body": [
        "In a small neighborhood in Rotterdam, there is a white refrigerator on the sidewalk. It is not broken, and it is not trash. It is a community fridge, and it is full of free food.",
        "The idea is simple. People who have extra food put it in the fridge. A baker brings the bread that he did not sell. Families bring vegetables from their gardens. Anyone who is hungry can open the door and take what they need. No money changes hands, and no one asks questions.",
        "Volunteers clean the fridge every day and check the dates on the food. \"It is about dignity, not charity,\" says Marta, one of the volunteers. \"Good food should feed people, not landfills.\""
      ],
      "gloss": {
        "neighborhood": "lingkungan",
        "sidewalk": "trotoar",
        "free": "gratis",
        "extra": "berlebih",
        "anyone": "siapa saja",
        "volunteers": "relawan",
        "dignity": "harga diri",
        "charity": "amal",
        "landfills": "tempat pembuangan akhir"
      },
      "qs": [
        {
          "q": "What is special about the white refrigerator?",
          "opts": [
